2. Revision 8.00 Distribution
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
Just to make sure that everything's clear about what's happening with 
Revision 8.00 of the WCST Nethack Spoilers, here's the scoop:

A) Revision 8.00 is not yet finished, nor is the commercial version of 
Revision 8.00 yet available.

B) Parts of Revision 8.00 are finished, and I am releasing those (pent up 
demand and all that).  As I finish additional sections, they will also be 
released.  All releases will be both by e-mail to the WCST e-mailing list and 
by post to rec.games.hack.

C) The Table of Contents has already been distributed, showing how the pieces 
fit together.  It will periodically be included with segments.

D) All distributions are governed by the WCST Nethack Spoiler License 
Agreement.  If you would like a copy of the full text of the license 
agreement, please send me e-mail.

E) When Revision 8.00 is complete, it will be posted in its entirety to 
rec.games.hack and comp.sources.games, as well as CompuServe and several ftp 
sites.  The commercial version will become available at that time.

F) At that point, I will take a couple days off, and then delve into the WCST 
Nethack Bestiary.  (There's so much information in Revision 8.00 that I'm 
taking the monster information out and putting it into a separate volume.)

